<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Intraday gap scan: price gaps vs. yesterday's close -> the trade-alert ledger.

  Runs `market-intelligence market scan-gaps` every 15 minutes, 08:30-15:00
  local time (= 9:30am-4:00pm ET, NYSE regular hours), every weekday —
  Michael wants alert coverage throughout the trading day, not just one
  pre-market check. Each run fetches a fresh live quote per ticker (see
  collectors/gaps.py), so later runs pick up gaps that widen or newly appear
  as the day trades, not stale repeats. Per-ticker dedup is enforced upstream
  (trigger_key = today's date, first-firing-wins) — a ticker that already
  fired today will not fire again today no matter how many times this scan
  runs, so higher frequency adds coverage, not duplicate noise.

  15 minutes was chosen deliberately, not arbitrarily: the quote source
  (Yahoo's unofficial endpoint, see clients/market_yfinance.py) is free but
  paced at 0.15s/symbol across a ~500-ticker universe, so a full sweep takes
  a couple of minutes — going much tighter than 15 min risks runs
  overlapping or hammering an unofficial free endpoint. This is the fastest
  cadence that's still polite to the data source and gives every run room to
  finish before the next one starts. A busy DuckDB lock (another collector or
  the relationship extractor holding the write lock) makes any single run
  skip and exit 0 — see collectors/gaps.py — so an occasional missed tick
  just means the next one 15 minutes later picks it up; it's not a launchd
  failure.

  Contains NO secrets: the app loads `.env` (git-ignored) itself, which is
  where MARKET_INTELLIGENCE_HOME and the optional TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN /
  TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID live. A missing Telegram token just skips the send; the
  ledger is still written.

  Install:
    cp config/launchd/ai.quant.morning-scan.plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents/
    launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/ai.quant.morning-scan.plist
  Run once now to test:
    launchctl start ai.quant.morning-scan
  Uninstall:
    launchctl unload ~/Library/LaunchAgents/ai.quant.morning-scan.plist
-->
